    <Node ToolID="701">
      <GuiSettings Plugin="AlteryxGuiToolkit.TextBox.TextBox">
        <Position x="1110" y="715" width="648" height="492" />
      </GuiSettings>
      <Properties>
        <Configuration>
          <Text><![CDATA[Items to check/update:

1. Update workflow title.

2. Action (Tool ID 129)
     - update Jurisdiction reference in formula

3. When pulling system feed outputs (.yxdb files),
     - copy Filter and Dynamic Input tools
     - update filter for next .yxdb file to use as input
     - Run feed to pull data through for data transformation

4. Use the container tool templates at the top of workflow canvas to add new sections. Data Sections should be contained within the Transformations container.
     - Use Data Sections to group data based on module or category

]]></Text>
          <Font name="Arial" size="15.75" style="0" />
          <TextColor name="Black" />
          <FillColor name="White" />
          <Shape shape="0" />
          <Justification Justification="3" />
        </Configuration>
